A '''Rusty Coin''' is an {{Uncommon}} item obtained from [[Fishing]] while using a {{Item|Junk Sinker}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Rusty Coin''' can be obtained as a {{RMCT|&5&lGOOD &2&lJUNK &5&lCATCH}} by fishing with a {{Item|Junk Sinker}} applied to a [[Fishing Rod]].

== Usage ==
